<title>ISRAEL: Israel grain, meal, soy arrivals detailed.</title>
<headline>Israel grain, meal, soy arrivals detailed.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following shipments of grain have arrived or are due to arrive in Israeli ports, according to the inspection agency Hevra Klalit Lehashgaha (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel	     ETA	   Cargo	    Quantity   Origin</p>
<p>Severdonesk	arrived     sunflower meal  1,500     Europe</p>
<p>Fany arrived     corn	     21,733     U.S.</p>
<p>		     soya		8,976</p>
<p>				     wheat	     9,081</p>
<p>Fedral Dora	arrived     barley	    9,900     U.S.</p>
<p>				     wheat	     5,690</p>
<p>				     wheat	     9,620</p>
<p>Tonglacky	  arrived     maize grits     2,700     Europe</p>
<p>Nicolay	    arrived     rapeseed meal   4,522     India</p>
<p>Dobrelybov</p>
<p>Ivonne	     arrived     corn		4,123     Europe</p>
<p>Bodayabo	   30/12	 sunflower	 1,849     Europe</p>
<p>Polinova	   30/12	 sunflower meal  1,500     Europe</p>
<p>Unity		01/01	 sorghum	  10,500     U.S.</p>
<p>				     corn	     22,000</p>
<p>				     corn-gluten    11,300</p>
