<p>Chupa 06/01	 wheat	     3,000     Europe</p>
<p>Laketahoy	  06/01	 barley	   20,000     U.S.</p>
<p>Volgobal 116     10/01	 bran		2,000     Europe</p>
<p>Solidarnosk	15/01	 n/a		60,000     U.S.</p>
